{"id":"g1637","title":"Cartilago/Mandragora comp. (ext.)","description":"Äußere Anwendung des anthroposophischen Kompositionspräparats Cartilago/Mandragora comp. bei aktivierten Gonarthrosen mit knöcherner Deformation.","blocks":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Hersteller"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Zusammensetzung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Zusammensetzung: 10 g Salbe enthalten: 0,1 g Antimonit D4, 0,1 g Argentum metallicum D6, 0,1 g Betula pendula D1, 0,1 g Cartilago articularis bovis Gl D3, 0,1 g Mandragora officinarum e radice D1. "}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Indikationen"}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"indication","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Aktivierte Gonarthrose mit knöcherner Deformation "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"a1506","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Dosierung"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Nachts Salbenumschlag für 3–6 Wo.; messerrückendick Salbe auftragen, dabei immer denselben Verband benutzen (Verbandsmaterial nicht wechseln). "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Wirkungseintritt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Besserung nach 1–2 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Therapiedauer"}]},{"type":"text","text":": 3–6 Wo. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Weitere Empfehlungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Intensivierung der Wirksamkeit durch Begleittherapie mit folgender Mischspritze möglich: 1 Amp. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0155.html","id":"10885","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Cartilago comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA oder "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0721.html","id":"10886","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Cartilago/Mandragora comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA, 1 Amp. "},{"type":"inline","id":"10887","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Iscucin® Mali"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Stärke C bis F WALA (vgl. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0118.html","id":"10888","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Viscum album (nicht onkologisch)"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), gequaddelt an den 4 „Knieaugen“ (=„Ecken“ der Kniescheibe). "},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Siehe auch "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0421.html","id":"10889","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Stannum metallicum (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WELEDA."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Auch über längere Zeit 3 x tgl. 7–10 Glob. "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g0721.html","id":"10890","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Cartilago/Mandragora comp."}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Ergänzende Therapiemöglichkeit besteht in Anwendung von Schwefelbädern."}]}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Differentialtherapeutischer Hinweis"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Bei Gonarthrose ohne deutliche Entzündungszeichen "},{"type":"link","href":"/offline/documents/med/de05/g1636.html","id":"10891","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Cartilago comp. (ext.)"}]},{"type":"text","text":" WALA. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Bemerkungen"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Die ursprüngliche Einsendung nannte unter „Weitere Empfehlungen“ Viscum Pini. Nach breiter Erfahrung ist allerdings Iscucin® Mali bei Gonarthrose geeigneter als Pini, daher erfolgte eine redaktionelle Änderung in diesem Sinn. "}]},{"type":"item","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Berichtender Arzt"}]},{"type":"text","text":": WS. "}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"01JJ73XD8KGJVFBCVAM0C751P4","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Zugelassenes Anwendungsgebiet "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"application-01JJ73XD8KGJVFBCVAM0C751P4","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Verformende Arthrose (Arthrosis deformans) im entzündlichen Stadium; primär chronische, deformierende Gelenkentzündung (Polyarthritis)."}]}]}]}]},{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"heading","id":"R1637","level":4,"children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"text","text":" Literatur "}]}]},{"type":"group","id":"literature-R1637","children":[{"type":"group","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Deggeller L. Rheumatische Erkrankungen im Spannungsfeld von Entzündung und Degeneration. Therapiemöglichkeiten der Arthrose. Beiträge zu einer Erweiterung der Heilkunst 1985; 38(Sonderheft Referate vom Deutschen Kongreß für ärztliche Fortbildung, Berlin, 14. Juni 1984): 27–32. "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-14799-DE","children":[{"type":"text","text":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-14799-DE"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Roemer F. Therapiekonzepte der Anthroposophischen Medizin. 1. Aufl. Stuttgart: Karl F. Haug Verlag 2014; 76f, 223."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Roemer F. Therapiekonzepte der Anthroposophischen Medizin. Stufenpläne mit Differenzialdiagnostik. 2. Aufl. Stuttgart, New York: Georg Thieme Verlag 2018; 76, 78, 233."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","text":"Spannagel H. Krebsbilanz meiner Patientinnen mit Mamma-Carcinom. Teil VII. Der Merkurstab 1995; 48(6): 524–535. "},{"type":"link","href":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-16796-DE","children":[{"type":"text","text":"https://doi.org/10.14271/DMS-16796-DE"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]}]}]}]}